# Devin

> Devin is an AI coding agent and software engineer built by Cognition. Engineering teams use parallel cloud agents to fix bugs, ship features, refactor code, and review PRs. Devin is available as a cloud service (app.devin.ai), a desktop app, a CLI, and a JetBrains plugin.

Indexable pages on devin.ai are also available as Markdown: request the page URL with `Accept: text/markdown`, or append `.md` to the path (for example https://devin.ai/pricing.md, or https://devin.ai/index.md for the homepage).

